[   26422ms] [LOG] [Section 2] Loading blocks, raw metadata: [{"content": "\u003cp\u003eThe second part of the case study focused on assessing the vulnerability and risk of the Districts to current and future landslides. Therefore, a \u003cstrong\u003elandslide susceptibility map\u003c/strong\u003e was developed to identify the areas potentially at risk of landslides, their runouts or the subsequent debris flows and floods using modelling techniques. This allowed to identify potential \u003cstrong\u003eareas at risk\u003c/strong\u003e, and particularly \u003cstrong\u003eschools\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003ehealth facilities\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eroads\u003c/strong\u003e. In the following maps, an overview of the landslide risks can be identified.\u003c/p\u003e", "type": "text"}, {"tabs": [{"height": "600px", "title": "Landslide Susceptibility Map", "url": "https://ihp-wins.unesco.org/terria/#share=g-74743b0a90130139249536e24d056667", "width": "100%"}, {"height": "600px", "title": "Schools at risk from Landslides", "url": "https://ihp-wins.unesco.org/terria/#share=g-48191ccd1cda59ebbbc9e5f1b83dc4cd", "width": "100%"}, {"height": "600px", "title": "Health Facilities at risk from Landslides", "url": "https://ihp-wins.unesco.org/terria/#share=g-9a04aaf47c40195d324234265cfd22cc", "width": "100%"}, {"height": "600px", "title": "Secondary Schools at risk from landslides", "url": "https://ihp-wins.unesco.org/terria/#share=g-830a0b9a9372b9c8b81cacae24bb8760", "width": "100%"}], "type": "terria"}] @ https://data.dev-wins.com/js/data-stories-edit.js?v=20260827-1:956
